SHAPEFILE_1_DEF nz-building-outlines   shapefile_type               shapefile_polygon   building_i                   long   name                         varchar(71)   use                          varchar(11)   suburb_loc                   varchar(48)   town_city                    varchar(48)   territoria                   varchar(34)   capture_me                   varchar(23)   capture_so                   varchar(18)   capture__1                   long   capture__2                   varchar(62)   capture__3                   date   capture__4                   date   last_modif                   date
